After searching linux.org LUG list and not finding any LUGs for the
Western Suburbs of Chicago, IL (US), I am trying to start a LUG called
the DuPage Linux Users Group - http://home.comcast.net/~du-lug/

DuLUG is primarily aimed at the Western Suburbs of Chicago.  This
includes, but is not exclusive to: Lombard, Wheaton, Lisle, Downers
Grove, Lisle, Elmhurst, Westmont, and other communities in the area.
All are welcome from beginners to the experienced.

If you are interested in joining please contact me (Phil) at
flosofl@comcast.net

Anyone interested in helping organize, including hosting, finding a
better meeting location than Border's, and web design (especially web
design!) please contact me at flosofl@comcast.net

Thank You,
Phil Frederick

